/E (This project fits into a broader initiative on data centre energy management with colocated renewable energy, aligning computational demand with on-site solar generation, storage, and grid signals. While the supply-side focuses on power delivery, this report addresses the demand-side: minimizing the power required by AI inference workloads)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [10]
>>
