224 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 373 0 R
/E (DeBERTa-v3-base \(Small Model\): A compact model featuring 184 million parameters, fine-tuned specifically for the NLI task, processing both sentences together and outputting the classification directly. Memory utilization stood at $0.69\\text{ GB}$. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
225 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 374 0 R
/E (Mistral-7B-Instruct \(Large Model\): A general-purpose LLM with 7 billion parameters, prompted zero-shot with instructions and 6 examples, outputting 'Yes', 'No', or 'Maybe'. To fit within the GPU memory limits, it was quantized to 4-bit \(NF4\), utilizing $3.74\\text{ GB}$ of memory. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
