227 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 70 0 R
/E (The benchmark task is Natural Language Inference \(SNLI\), which requires reading two sentences \(a premise and a hypothesis\) and determining their logical relationship: Entailment \(must be true\), Contradiction \(cannot be true\), or Neutral \(maybe true\). Unclear pairs were filtered out, and a balanced subset of 1,000 sentence pairs was randomly sampled for evaluation.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
